#: ../../technical/articles/192-aeat-official-reference-corpus.md:46
msgid ""
"Content inspection was representative and bounded as requested. No "
"attempt was made to read the 780+ MB corpus as a whole, reconstruct every"
" model's legal layout, validate every spreadsheet/PDF extraction, or "
"verify the archived sources against AEAT live pages. The sampled files "
"and manifests carry capture dates between 2026-05 and 2026-08; as-of "
"freshness and legal validity remain outside this static pass. The "
"archived workbook sidecar hash checks establish only that the sampled "
"extraction points to the corresponding archived raw file, not that "
"extraction is semantically complete."
msgstr ""

